{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866700/extras/8f9eb5da9a8ee9240acc8047f0126412.poster.avif?t=1758849083\" width=616 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866700/extras/8f9eb5da9a8ee9240acc8047f0126412.webm?t=1758849083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>No Sheep Left Behind</strong>, you guide a sheepdog through a procedurally generated trail, trying to collect and protect every sheep you find. With many threats along the way, what starts as a chill task can quickly become a desperate race for survival. Even veteran players will find it a challenge to last more than a few minutes without losing a single sheep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866700/extras/5b4a868286e88e69a2ff0deb444ece0c.gif?t=1758849083\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866700/extras/5b4a868286e88e69a2ff0deb444ece0c.poster.avif?t=1758849083\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your flock gets bigger, it becomes harder to protect. These sheep are completely helpless and face dangers at every turn. They can be eaten by wolves, shot at by archers, scared away by angry farmers, drowned, or simply get lost. Your brave sheepdog is their only hope. Be careful, though\u2014don't push the sheepdog too hard, or he may get tired and temporarily refuse your commands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866700/extras/9af8a54d1ac3254157521cf6d9c4d558.gif?t=1758849083\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866700/extras/9af8a54d1ac3254157521cf6d9c4d558.poster.avif?t=1758849083\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortunately, you can try as many times as you like, learning from your mistakes with each run. Since the path is procedurally generated, every playthrough offers a different and unpredictable journey. So just chill, enjoy the ride, and remember: <strong>No Sheep Left Behind</strong>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3866700?t=1758849083","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3866700?t=1758849083","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866700/095a67f38219a8883af39780c12d116cbc0025be/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758849083","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866700/095a67f38219a8883af39780c12d116cbc0025be/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758849083","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866700/extras/8f9eb5da9a8ee9240acc8047f0126412.poster.avif?t=1758849083\" width=616 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866700/extras/8f9eb5da9a8ee9240acc8047f0126412.webm?t=1758849083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>No Sheep Left Behind</strong>, you guide a sheepdog through a procedurally generated trail, trying to collect and protect every sheep you find. With many threats along the way, what starts as a chill task can quickly become a desperate race for survival. Even veteran players will find it a challenge to last more than a few minutes without losing a single sheep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866700/extras/5b4a868286e88e69a2ff0deb444ece0c.gif?t=1758849083\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866700/extras/5b4a868286e88e69a2ff0deb444ece0c.poster.avif?t=1758849083\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your flock gets bigger, it becomes harder to protect. These sheep are completely helpless and face dangers at every turn. They can be eaten by wolves, shot at by archers, scared away by angry farmers, drowned, or simply get lost. Your brave sheepdog is their only hope. Be careful, though\u2014don't push the sheepdog too hard, or he may get tired and temporarily refuse your commands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866700/extras/9af8a54d1ac3254157521cf6d9c4d558.gif?t=1758849083\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866700/extras/9af8a54d1ac3254157521cf6d9c4d558.poster.avif?t=1758849083\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortunately, you can try as many times as you like, learning from your mistakes with each run. Since the path is procedurally generated, every playthrough offers a different and unpredictable journey. So just chill, enjoy the ride, and remember: <strong>No Sheep Left Behind</strong>.</p>","developers":["Occasionally Fun Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866700/4e1dde168fa8404f016